- **IC (test)**:
  - mean = 0.0590, std = 0.1391, ICIR = 0.42, HAC t-stat = 6.6 (lags=5)
- **RankIC (test)**:
  - mean = 0.0741, std = 0.1388, IR = 0.53, HAC t-stat = 8.5 (lags=5)
